WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.420 --> 00:00:03.434 line:10%
Yon devinèt : misk yon pasyan fèb,

2
00:00:03.434 --> 00:00:06.645 line:10%
men plis li sèvi ak yo, se plis yo vin pi fò.

3
00:00:06.645 --> 00:00:10.249 line:10%
Poukisa ? Repons lan kache nan junction neromiskilè a.

4
00:00:10.249 --> 00:00:12.935 line:10%
Sa a se sendwòm miyastenik Lambert-Eaton.

5
00:00:13.425 --> 00:00:18.185 line:10%
Nan junction neromiskilè a, yon enpilsyon nè louvri kanal kalsyòm ki depann de vòltaj.

6
00:00:18.185 --> 00:00:22.714 line:10%
Kalsyòm anvayi anndan, li pouse vezikil sinaptik yo fizyone epi lage asetilkolin,

7
00:00:22.714 --> 00:00:26.430 line:10%
ki aktive reseptè yo sou misk la epi deklanche kontraksyon.

8
00:00:26.921 --> 00:00:33.080 line:10%
Nan sendwòm miyastenik Lambert-Eaton, antikò atake kanal kalsyòm prezinaptik tip P/Q sa yo.

9
00:00:33.080 --> 00:00:37.416 line:10%
Lè kanal yo bloke, gen anpil mwens kalsyòm ki antre nan tèminal nè a.

10
00:00:37.906 --> 00:00:40.174 line:10%
Mwens kalsyòm vle di mwens vezikil fizyone,

11
00:00:40.174 --> 00:00:44.538 line:10%
kidonk se yon ti kras asetilkolin sèlman ki lage, epi siyal misk la fèb.

12
00:00:44.538 --> 00:00:48.846 line:10%
Sa ki revelatè, fòs la amelyore yon ti moman ak itilizasyon repete, pandan kalsyòm ap akimile.

13
00:00:49.384 --> 00:00:52.810 line:10%
Se la Firdapse antre : amifampridin, oswa 3,4-DAP.

14
00:00:52.810 --> 00:00:57.338 line:10%
Li bloke kanal potasyòm prezinaptik yo, ki pwolonje depolarizasyon nè a.

15
00:00:57.338 --> 00:00:59.428 line:10%
Sa kenbe kanal kalsyòm yo louvri pi lontan,

16
00:00:59.428 --> 00:01:03.028 line:10%
konsa plis kalsyòm pase nan kanal ki rete yo.

17
00:01:03.028 --> 00:01:05.814 line:10%
Plis kalsyòm, plis vezikil, plis asetilkolin,

18
00:01:05.814 --> 00:01:07.382 line:10%
epi siyal la retabli.

19
00:01:07.872 --> 00:01:09.638 line:10%
Li pa kapab retire antikò yo,

20
00:01:09.638 --> 00:01:12.177 line:10%
kidonk li senpleman fòse plis kalsyòm antre.

21
00:01:12.757 --> 00:01:13.598 line:10%
An rezime.

22
00:01:13.598 --> 00:01:18.639 line:10%
LEMS koze pa oto-antikò kont kanal kalsyòm prezinaptik tip P/Q.

23
00:01:18.639 --> 00:01:22.065 line:10%
Mwens kalsyòm k ap antre vle di mwens asetilkolin ki lage,

24
00:01:22.065 --> 00:01:23.810 line:10%
epi yon aktivasyon misk ki fèb.

25
00:01:23.810 --> 00:01:27.753 line:10%
Kontrèman ak myasthenia gravis, fòs la amelyore ak itilizasyon repete.

26
00:01:27.753 --> 00:01:32.213 line:10%
Souvan li paraneoplazik, klasikman lye ak kansè poumon a ti selil.

27
00:01:32.213 --> 00:01:34.864 line:10%
Epi yo trete l ak Firdapse, 3,4-DAP,

28
00:01:34.864 --> 00:01:40.293 line:10%
ki bloke kanal potasyòm pou fè plis kalsyòm antre, ak plis asetilkolin soti.
